  fro-usc:hasContentText "the appropriate Federal banking agency, with respect to institutions described in section 1813(q) of this title , except to the extent that an institution is or the activities of an institution are otherwise described in subparagraph (B), (C), (D), or (E);" ;
  fro-usc:hasId "id8390f016-1df7-11e6-87ee-8e4a3ab90f2a" ;
