fro-usc-t12-ch53:id83936041-1df7-11e6-87ee-8e4a3ab90f2a
  rdf:type fro-usc:USC_Note ;
  fro-leg-ref:hasSequenceNumber 0 ;
  fro-ref:hasSourceInstance <http://finregont.com/fro/usc/USC-2015-title12-chapter53.ttl#r-1-0-4-3-22-0> ;
  fro-usc:hasHeading "References in Text" ;
  fro-usc:hasId "id83936041-1df7-11e6-87ee-8e4a3ab90f2a" ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Subchapter I, referred to in par. (8), was in the original “title I”, meaning title I of Pub. L. 111–203 , July 21, 2010 , 124 Stat. 1391 , known as the Financial Stability Act of 2010, which is classified principally to subchapter I (§ 5311 et seq.) of this chapter. For complete classification of title I to the Code, see Short Title note below and Tables." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "The Commodity Exchange Act, referred to in par. (12)(C), is act Sept. 21, 1922, ch. 369 , 42 Stat. 998 , which is classified generally to chapter 1 (§ 1 et seq.) of Title 7, Agriculture. For complete classification of this Act to the Code, see section 1 of Title 7 and Tables." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "The Investment Advisers Act of 1940, referred to in par. (12)(B)(iii), is title II of act Aug. 22, 1940, ch. 686 , 54 Stat. 847 , which is classified generally to subchapter II (§ 80b–1 et seq.) of chapter 2D of Title 15, Commerce and Trade. For complete classification of this Act to the Code, see section 80b–20 of Title 15 and Tables." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "The Investment Company Act of 1940, referred to in par. (12)(B)(ii), is title I of act Aug. 22, 1940, ch. 686 , 54 Stat. 789 , which is classified generally to subchapter I (§ 80a–1 et seq.) of chapter 2D of Title 15, Commerce and Trade. For complete classification of this Act to the Code, see section 80a–51 of Title 15 and Tables." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "The Sarbanes-Oxley Act of 2002, referred to in par. (12)(B)(xi), is Pub. L. 107–204 , July 30, 2002 , 116 Stat. 745 , which is classified principally to chapter 98 (§ 7201 et seq.) of Title 15, Commerce and Trade. For complete classification of this Act to the Code, see Short Title note set out under section 7201 of Title 15 and Tables." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "The Securities Exchange Act of 1934, referred to in par. (12)(B), is act June 6, 1934, ch. 404 , 48 Stat. 881 , which is classified principally to chapter 2B (§ 78a et seq.) of Title 15, Commerce and Trade. For complete classification of this Act to the Code, see section 78a of Title 15 and Tables." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "The Securities Investor Protection Act of 1970, referred to in par. (12)(B)(xii), is Pub. L. 91–598 , Dec. 30, 1970 , 84 Stat. 1636 , which is classified generally to chapter 2B–1 (§ 78aaa et seq.) of Title 15, Commerce and Trade. For complete classification of this Act to the Code, see section 78aaa of Title 15 and Tables." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "This Act, referred to in text, is Pub. L. 111–203 , July 21, 2010 , 124 Stat. 1376 , known as the Dodd-Frank Wall Street Reform and Consumer Protection Act, which enacted this chapter and chapters 108 (§ 8201 et seq.) and 109 (§ 8301 et seq.) of Title 15, Commerce and Trade, and enacted, amended, and repealed numerous other sections and notes in the Code. For complete classification of this Act to the Code, see Short Title note below and Tables." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Title III, referred to in par. (2), is title III of Pub. L. 111–203 . , July 21, 2010 , 124 Stat. 1520 . Section 312(c)(1) of title III of Pub. L. 111–203 amended section 1813(q) of this title" ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Title X, referred to in par. (4), is title X of Pub. L. 111–203 , July 21, 2010 , 124 Stat. 1955 , known as the Consumer Financial Protection Act of 2010, which enacted subchapter V (§ 5481 et seq.) of this chapter, and enacted, amended, and repealed numerous other sections and notes in the Code. For complete classification of title X to the Code, see Short Title note below and Tables." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteTopic "referencesInText" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/act/1922-09-21/ch369" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/act/1934-06-06/ch404" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/act/1940-08-22/ch686" ;
