  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Section 1204(c) of the Financial Institutions Reform, Recovery, and Enforcement Act of 1989, referred to in subsec. (g)(3), is section 1204(c) of Pub. L. 101–73 , which is set out as a note under section 1811 of this title ." ;
