  fro-usc:hasContentText "the information described in subclause (I)(aa) is not used by such person or affiliate in connection with any decision regarding the offering or provision of a consumer financial product or service to the consumer, other than credit described in section 5517(a)(2)(A) of this title ;" ;
  fro-usc:hasId "id83a673f6-1df7-11e6-87ee-8e4a3ab90f2a" ;
